      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……！　这才是只有我才能做到的展开……！\n就照这个感觉把大纲再打磨一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6230a6777b6a644fe654871ee04917bfd6a4533d3ab6a0d251dbb24a43059595",
