    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44904f7148a99ac3d2a1b089",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――以及在那场『日本杯』上，\n与杏目一同打破纪录的\n以自由自在的跑法驰名的神业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f2b527c4e42a5f15e2cf5b47bf3deaab77a831b53db5b17d7d683338b16c18c",
